## 🔎 3.1 Reading Input with TextBox Controls
- **TextBox Control:** Waa meel afar-gees ah oo adeegsadaha ka qaadata qoraalka uu ku qoro keyboard-ka. [1]
- **Text Property:** Waxay kaydisaa wixii qoraal ah oo lagu dhex qoro TextBox-ka, waxayna aqbashaa oo kaliya qaabka `string`. [1]
  ```csharp
  textBox1.Text = "Hello";
  textBox1.Clear(); // Si aad u tirtirto qoraalka dhex jira
  ```

---

## 💡 3.2 A First Look at Variables
- **Variable:** Waa meel xogta lagu kaydiyo oo ku dhex taal xusuusta kombiyuutarka (Memory). [1]
- **Primitive Data Types:** Waa noocyada xogta ee aasaasiga ah ee barnaamijka C# u diyaarsan, sida `int`, `double`, `decimal`, `char`, `bool`, iyo `string`. [1]
- **String Concatenation:** Waa isku xirka labo qoraal barnaamijka dhexdiisa ayadoo la isticmaalayo calaamadda `+`. [1]
  ```csharp
  string fullname = firstNameTextBox.Text + " " + lastNameTextBox.Text;
  ```

---

## 📊 3.3 Numeric Data Types and Variables
- `int`: Waxay kaydisaa lambarada guud ee aan jajabka lahayn (Whole numbers). [1]
- `double`: Waxay kaydisaa lambarada jajabka leh ee caadiga ah. [1]
- `decimal`: Waxay kaydisaa lambarada jajabka ah ee saxnaanta weyn u baahan, sida xisaabaadka maaliyadda. [1]
  ```csharp
  int hoursWorked = 40;
  double temperature = 87.6;
  decimal payRate = 28.75m; // Lambarka decimal-ka waxaa mar walba lagu daraa "m" ama "M"
  ```

---

## 📈 3.4 Performing Calculations
Barnaamijka C# wuxuu u isticmaalaa calaamadahan xisaabinta: [1]
- Iskudar: `+` [1]
- Kala goynta: `-` [1]
- Isku dhufasho: `*` [1]
- Qeybin: `/` [1]
- Haraga qeybta (Modulus): `%` [1]

---

## 📥 3.5 Inputting and Outputting Numeric Values
- **Parse Methods:** Maadaama TextBox-ku uu qoraal ahaan xogta u qaado, waxaan isticmaalnaa hababkan si loogu beddelo lambaro: [1]
  ```csharp
  int hours = int.Parse(hoursWorkedTextBox.Text);
  double temp = double.Parse(temperatureTextBox.Text);
  ```

---

## 🎨 3.6 Formatting Numbers with the ToString Method
- Waxaad u isticmaali kartaa qaababkan si aad lambarka u muujiso: [1]
  - `ToString("C")` -> Wuxuu u beddelaa qaab Lacag ah (Currency). [1]
  - `ToString("N")` -> Wuxuu ku darayaa commas iyo jajab caadi ah. [1]

---

## ⚠️ 3.7 Simple Exception Handling
- **Exception (try-catch):** Waxaa loo isticmaalaa in lagu qabto khaladaadka dhaca barnaamijka inta uu socdo (sida qoraal lagu qoray meel lambar laga rabay) si uusan barnaamijku u jabin. [1]
  ```csharp
  try
  {
      double miles = double.Parse(milesTextBox.Text);
  }
  catch (Exception ex)
  {
      MessageBox.Show(ex.Message); // Wuxuu soo bandhigayaa farriinta khaladka
  }
  ```

---

